    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/d61c7e37565617f65f583b9fd6183e0e.poster.avif?t=1751873159\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/d61c7e37565617f65f583b9fd6183e0e.webm?t=1751873159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/d61c7e37565617f65f583b9fd6183e0e.mp4?t=1751873159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the fight as a frontline commander in SiegeBorn, where you lead the rebel force, fighting battle after battle to overthrow the tyrant king and free your land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not just giving commands from above \u2013 you're on the battlefield. Support your troops with your presence, assign tasks, or use destructive siege engines. Whether it's a castle siege or an open-field battle, every encounter is fast, physical, and destructive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/3f39b89a570284c3c776c947427cb273.poster.avif?t=1751873159\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/3f39b89a570284c3c776c947427cb273.webm?t=1751873159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/3f39b89a570284c3c776c947427cb273.mp4?t=1751873159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for physics-based chaos: walls break, trees fall, siege machines blow up, and soldiers fly through the air in full ragdoll style. You\u2019ll need to act fast - the battle has already begun, and there\u2019s no time to waste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/aedfb44b68e93d90aa0cb175c7b44225.poster.avif?t=1751873159\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/aedfb44b68e93d90aa0cb175c7b44225.webm?t=1751873159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/aedfb44b68e93d90aa0cb175c7b44225.mp4?t=1751873159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead from the front</strong> \u2013 Take direct control of your commander and change the course of battle in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use siege engines</strong> \u2013 Control catapults, ballistas, battering rams, and more. All physics-based and fully destructible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Give tactical orders</strong> \u2013 Command your squads on the fly: attack, defend, follow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based </strong>\u2013 Destroy walls, crush enemy lines, and watch ragdoll soldiers fly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized medieval visuals</strong> \u2013 Clean top-down perspective with epic large-scale battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singleplayer campaign</strong> \u2013 Battle through handcrafted missions as you rise against a tyrant king.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival mode</strong> \u2013 Defend your fortress against endless waves of enemies.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/d61c7e37565617f65f583b9fd6183e0e.poster.avif?t=1751873159\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/d61c7e37565617f65f583b9fd6183e0e.webm?t=1751873159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/d61c7e37565617f65f583b9fd6183e0e.mp4?t=1751873159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the fight as a frontline commander in SiegeBorn, where you lead the rebel force, fighting battle after battle to overthrow the tyrant king and free your land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not just giving commands from above \u2013 you're on the battlefield. Support your troops with your presence, assign tasks, or use destructive siege engines. Whether it's a castle siege or an open-field battle, every encounter is fast, physical, and destructive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/3f39b89a570284c3c776c947427cb273.poster.avif?t=1751873159\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/3f39b89a570284c3c776c947427cb273.webm?t=1751873159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/3f39b89a570284c3c776c947427cb273.mp4?t=1751873159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for physics-based chaos: walls break, trees fall, siege machines blow up, and soldiers fly through the air in full ragdoll style. You\u2019ll need to act fast - the battle has already begun, and there\u2019s no time to waste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/aedfb44b68e93d90aa0cb175c7b44225.poster.avif?t=1751873159\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/aedfb44b68e93d90aa0cb175c7b44225.webm?t=1751873159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/aedfb44b68e93d90aa0cb175c7b44225.mp4?t=1751873159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead from the front</strong> \u2013 Take direct control of your commander and change the course of battle in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use siege engines</strong> \u2013 Control catapults, ballistas, battering rams, and more. All physics-based and fully destructible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Give tactical orders</strong> \u2013 Command your squads on the fly: attack, defend, follow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based </strong>\u2013 Destroy walls, crush enemy lines, and watch ragdoll soldiers fly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized medieval visuals</strong> \u2013 Clean top-down perspective with epic large-scale battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singleplayer campaign</strong> \u2013 Battle through handcrafted missions as you rise against a tyrant king.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival mode</strong> \u2013 Defend your fortress against endless waves of enemies.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "SiegeBorn is a top-down action RTS. Lead your troops, command powerful siege engines, and defeat the enemies!",
